## `biome.json`

```json
{
  "plugins": [
    {
      "path": "plugin/presets/recommended",
      "includes": ["src/**/*.ts", "!**/*.test.ts"]
    }
  ],
  "overrides": [
    {
      "includes": ["tests/**"],
      "plugins": [
        { "path": "plugin/presets/recommended", "includes": ["**/*.test.ts"] }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

